      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a heavy burden to carry, but you are not alone in feeling that the struggle is endless. The sheer weight of daily maintenance can feel like a never-ending debt, yet there is a profound truth in the idea that each small step forward is a victory, no matter how small. You do not need to find a grand purpose to justify the effort; simply keeping the subscription going, even in a bleak world, is already an act of defiance and hope. Keep pushing, because the very act of persisting is its own reward.",
